window.products.push({"id":915017,"name":"Lawei 2 Pack Ceramic Butter Crock, French Glass Butter Container with Lid, Original Butter Dish Keeper for Countertop, Table Porcelain Butter Holder, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610818vnSsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Butter Crock Size: Package included 2 pack ceramic butter crocks, each butter keeper size: 4\" x 4\" x 4.7\". The word \"butter\" is cast on one side, a perfect accent to any kitchen or counter décor. Butter crock is equipped with 8 small transparent feet, which can be attached under the glass container to prevent the glass from being worn, and better avoid the friction between the glass and the desktop. Premium Ceramic and Glass Material: Lawei porcelain butter crock is made of durable professional grade porcelain - a type of premium Lead-free and no-toxic ceramic, chip-resistant and more sturdy than stoneware. Notice: This butter glass base can used to dishwasher and freezer.But can not used to microwave, oven. Large Capacity: Our french butter container holds about one stick or cube (1/2 cup or 125 grams) of your favorite butter, or your own homemade butter. It is extremely practical for your family, also a perfect gift for all occasions. Refresh the water each day or every 2-3 days. Transparents Butter Container: These butter dish have the uniform color appearance with the clear glass body. Unlike traditional porcelain bottoms, the glass bottom does not need to worry about too much or too little water level, and the glass bottom is clearly visible. Dishwasher safe for easy clean up. Savor Spreadable Butter: Easy to spread for use on toast, rolls, bread, waffles, pancakes and so on. Use the butter keeper container could stay away from the fridge, the butter keeps the soft, spreadable and original taste, making it a simple cooking accessory. You will love its convenience once you use it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610818vnSsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lawei","source_asin":"B0B5K49WZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-915017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5K49WZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5K49WZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
