window.products.push({"id":915031,"name":"Stainless Steel Julienne Peeler and Vegetable Peeler Two in One Blade Tool with Cleaning Brush and Ceramic Paring Knife - Manufacturer Lifetime Guaran","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51T5QdET-aL._AC_.jpg","description":"Searching for a fun & exciting way to eat healthier? - We promote Healthy Eating! Stop eating high carb pasta noodles! Replace the wheat with healthy vegetable noodles. Start a New Healthy Lifestyle for you and your family with this Premium Vegetable and Salad making set! Your Children won't eat veggies? => Use the julienne peeler and make veggies fun for picky kids!This tool is ideal for creating Raw, Paleo, Vegan, Low-Carb, Weight Loss and Gluten-free food! Here are a few Tips You'll Love: ♥ Make nice long julienne strips, vegetable pasta and zucchini noodles or zoodles like in the restaurant ♥ Perfect for Stir Fry ♥ Grade chocolate for tasty deserts ♥ A good alternative to bulky spiral slicers ♥ Incredible multi purpose tool with built in Julienne Peeler ♥ Peel, slice and julienne vegetables in an instant! ♥ Create Beautiful salads for your loved ones and guests ♥ Perfect as a gift for Moms, healthy-conscious people and friends. “You can use a variety of firm fruits and vegetables including apples, potatoes, carrots, cucumber, zucchini and diakon radish, and more. Whether you're a vegetable fanatic, attempting to clean up your diet, or are just looking for great paleo and/or gluten free options to traditional pasta, zoodling takes you WAY beyond the spaghetti squash.\" by David & Donna Lewis Package contents: ✔ Stainless Steel Double Blade Julienne and Vegetable Peeler ✔ Flexible Cleaning Brush ✔ (BONUS) 6.7 inch Ceramic Knife with Blade protector Total Package Value is Over $40 - Save 65% by Purchasing NOW! Get it your own Julienne Peeler NOW by scroll to the top right of the page and click the \"Add to Cart\" Button!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51T5QdET-aL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BigChef","source_asin":"B00ZKQI3Y4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-915031","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZKQI3Y4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZKQI3Y4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":915032,"name":"BaoNews Silver Christmas Gnomes Kitchen Valances for Windows,Blue Green Landscape Christmas Tree Blackout Valances Curtains Multilayer Polyester Drape","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hJL2go2TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dimensions: Standard size 52x18 inch,set of 1 including 2 inch header and 3 inch rod pocket.After the curtain is straightened, it is suitable for windows with a length of 40-44 inches. If you want to make the curtain appear wrinkled, it is recommended to use the curtain for windows with a length of 26-35 inches. Material: The valance is made of 2 layers of high quality polyester fabric with a black shading layer in the middle. High-definition laser-printing pattern is lively, vivid.Due to the black shading layer in the middle of the curtain, the overall tone is slightly gray. Production Characteristics: Different pattern is perfect for protecting privacy and reducing light.Cozy and flowing, just enough to soften a stark window frame without blocking natural light, Colorful valance is also a beautiful decoration and brings fun to your house. Care Guide:Easy to clean. Machine washable,aslo wash your hands gently with cold water and dry only in the shade. Wash with cold water and gently circulate. Dry at low temperature and do not bleach. You can easily iron at low temperatures. Special Reminder: There will be creases after the curtain is packaged, and the texture of the crease will become larger when it is unfolded, but it can be restored after it is flat. The surface of the curtain is smooth, and contact with sharp objects will scratch the fabric.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hJL2go2TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BaoNews","source_asin":"B0BMVKYPLJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-915032","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMVKYPLJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMVKYPLJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":915033,"name":"Van Gogh THE ALMOND BLOSSOMS Value Acrylic Painting Kit 11 X 14","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91W1XHq5UaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"11” x 14” Famous Art Kits are designed so that ANYONE can paint beautiful pictures inspired by famous artists- you will be amazed at the results even if you have no art background. Our kits are NOT STANDARD PAINT BY NUMBER kits- though the paint colors are numbered and the instruction manuals have some numbered areas, there are NO NUMBERS on the drawing because you don’t need them. Whereas most finished paint by numbers resemble jigsaw puzzles, our finished paintings look just like our advertising pictures. An accurate drawing of the scene is done for you on a genuine artist's canvas. The canvas is thick enough that no backing board is necessary to paint the picture. There is a backing board provided that the canvas can be taped or glued to using elmer's all purpose. With this board your finished painting will be ready to frame. The acrylic paints and quality artist brush are provided. If you have extra brushes that would add to your experience use them. Most of the acrylic colors are premixed- any color mixing can be done right on the picture. The instructions are comprehensive, yet easy to follow. There are color pictures showing each step of the painting, and you will build your painting from the ground up, one color at a time. These kits can be painted by beginners if they can follow directions and control a brush- they contain everything you need to finish the painting successfully. You will be actually learning to paint with acrylics. We use Deco Art Americana Acrylic Craft Paint which is the best on the market. You will never find any dried out paint in our kits- we make them to order to make sure the paint is fresh. Our kits are guaranteed 100%- if there is a problem, let us know and we will fix it. MADE IN THE USA BY ARTISTS FOR ARTISTS","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91W1XHq5UaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Famous Art Kits","source_asin":"B004QTHRBG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-915033","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004QTHRBG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004QTHRBG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
