window.products.push({"id":915182,"name":"Christmas Wooden Rolling Pin, Engraved Embossing Rolling Pin with Christmas Tree Deer Pattern for Baking Embossed Cookies,17 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vIayGgfkL._AC_.jpg","description":"🎅🦌Baking with embossed rolling pin can be very interesting, especially for children! The best design of the rolling pin to get good Embossment and beautiful biscuits. 🎁Total length: 43cm/17inch 🎁Roller diameter: 4.5cm/2inch 🎁Roller Length: 24.5cm/9.6inch 🎁Handle length: 9.25cm/3.6inch 🎅🦌Application: Can be used for Pasta, Cookies Dough, Pastries, Bakery, Pizza, Fondant, Roti Bread, Chapati and much more. 🎅🦌Maintenance and precautions: Because the product is made of natural materials, in the extreme cases such as exposure, flooding, high temperature and low humidity, cracking and mildew will occur. 🎅🦌After use, please dry with a dry cloth and store in a cool and ventilated place! Regularly apply vegetable oil to it in a dry environment to protect against cracking. 🎅🦌Some tips for the best results on your cookies (or pie, or pasta, etc.) 🌟Make sure the disks of dough are well-chilled so they're easy to roll out thin. 🌟If the dough is too soft and sticks to the hands, add more flour. 🌟No baking powder- better embossing result on the cookies. 🌟Add 1/4 starch (potato flour) instead of wheat flour. 🌟Be generous with the flour on your dough pads before embossing. Roll up approx. 0.2 inch (5 mm) thick pastry before rlling the patterm. 🌟Do not over-bake your cookies, the pattern will be less visible if you do so. 🌟Try out different recipes in small amounts so you can choose the one that works the best for you. 🌟If the dough stick, remove it with brush, do not allow the dough to harden. 🌟After use clean dry with a brush first, then if needed with water, soap and a brush. Dry well before using again. 🌟Do not wash in a dishwasher and try to avoid prolonged contact with water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vIayGgfkL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LDF","source_asin":"B081X9D7Z8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-915182","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081X9D7Z8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081X9D7Z8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
