window.products.push({"id":915210,"name":"Big Boss Cold Press Heavy Duty Slow Masticating Juicer with Reverse Function","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YwLm31+LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Big Boss Vitapress Pressure Juicer helps you create nutritious, fresh homemade juices. The juicer features a powerful low-wattage motor that effectively grinds fruits and vegetables into wholesome juice. With a large feeder tube, the Vitapress accommodates most fruits and vegetables, including leaves such as lettuce and spinach. The juicer also comes with cups for juice and pulp collection as well as a scrub brush to help thoroughly clean hard-to-reach areas. At a Glance: Powerful grinder maximizes nutrients in juice Powerful grinder maximizes nutrients in juice Large feeding tube and stainless steel strainer accept most fruits and vegetables Large feeding tube and stainless steel strainer accept most fruits and vegetables Juicer works continuously for up to 10 minutes Juicer works continuously for up to 10 minutes Included pusher helps you get the most out of your food Included pusher helps you get the most out of your food Scrub brush cleans even hard-to-reach areas Scrub brush cleans even hard-to-reach areas 120V/60Hz/150W 120V/60Hz/150W Reverse function for smooth operation Reverse function for smooth operation Safety feature protects the unit from overheating Safety feature protects the unit from overheating Easy-to-clean parts Easy-to-clean parts Low-speed , masticating-style juicing system Low-speed , masticating-style juicing system Squeezes instead of grinding, allowing the juice to maintain its pure color, natural taste, vitamins, and nutrients Squeezes instead of grinding, allowing the juice to maintain its pure color, natural taste, vitamins, and nutrients Small design saves space in your kitchen Small design saves space in your kitchen Juicer Preserves Nutrients for Healthy Homemade Juices With dual-stage extraction power and a powerful grinder, this slow juicer is able to press most vegetables and fruits into nutritious, fresh juice. The juicing process preserves the taste and essential nutrients in your foods, letting you create a variety of healthy drinks. Designed for Smooth Operation The Vitapress features a large feeder tube to help ensure that foods will not get stuck as you make juice. It also offers reverse operation, available on command or when the juicer needs to dislodge pieces. The reverse function also maximizes the juice you get from the machine. Additionally, the juicer's stainless steel strainer keeps pulp out of your drink, collecting it in a pulp collection cup for disposal. Up to 10 Minutes of Continuous Use The Vitapress features a long work time--up to 10 minutes of continuous use. A safety feature automatically turns the juicer off after 20 minutes of operation in order to cool down. Included Accessories for Simple and Safe Use With an included juice cup and pulp collection cup, the Vitapress makes it easy to juice your favorite fruits and vegetables. It also comes with a pusher that helps you push foods all the way through to be juiced, keeping your hands safe while allowing you to get the most out of your fruits and vegetables. Easy Cleaning with Included Brush The Big Boss Vitapress Pressure Juicer is easy to clean with the included scrub brush. The brush reaches areas that are difficult to get by hand, so your machine will be thoroughly clean. The juicer is not dishwasher safe. The Vitapress Juicer lets you make healthy, fresh juices at home. View larger . View larger . What's in the Box PartsFeaturesMain Power UnitContains powerful 150W motorjuice cupUsed for collecting the extracted juicepulp cupUsed for collecting the pulp (from juicing), meat/rice, noodlescleaning brushUsed for cleaning hard to reach areasFeeder TubeFood ingredients are fed through the tube to be processedSpiral PusherUsed for incorporating and grinding the ingredientsJuice StrainerFilters juice through a mesh strainer (used for vegetables and fruits)Large Juicing CapSafety feature that ensures proper assemblySmall Juicing CapConnects to large Juicing Cap, used for juice extractionPusherUsed for pushing ingredients close to the spiral pusher for higher juice extractionSmall Food TrayUsed for holding ingredients prior to juicingInstructions/Recipe BookContains important info as well as a variety of delicious recipes View larger .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YwLm31+LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Big Boss","source_asin":"B008J9YEU6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-915210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008J9YEU6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008J9YEU6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
