window.products.push({"id":915297,"name":"OurWarm Acrylic Table Numbers for Wedding 1-20, Clear Blank Acrylic Sign Table Number Holders with Detachable Base for Wedding Receptions Event Party ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PPU2NJH+L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"◆WHATS YOU GET: Set of 20pcs wedding table numbers with 20pcs acrylic table bases, each glass table number measure 4in x 6in. The modern and elegant acrylic sign holder for a very impressive look for formal receptions, corporate dinners, and weddings. ◆UPGRADED MATERIAL: Our clear table number signs are made of high-grade crystal clear acrylic sheets, which is durable and lightweight. We use advanced industrial laser cutting technology to provide accurate dimensions and smooth and flat edges. Each clear table numbers cards have a protective covering on both sides, to protect the product from scratches during transportation, pls peel off before use. ◆EASY TO USES: Simply insert the sheet into the base. You can use any water pen or oil-based paint pen to write on a clear blank acrylic sign. Easily wipe off with wet wipes. These craft table numbers sheets give DIY enthusiasts an opportunity to further embellish with a paint pen. ◆MULTI PURPOSE: Due to its clear design and elegant look, you can use our double-sided blank clear acrylic signs as a table menu display stand, a chic table numbers holder for wedding or party table card holder, wedding name place cards and ad sing for your desk or store. ◆VARIOUS OCCASIONS: Not only these wedding table number signs are perfect for weddings, engagement parties, bridal shower, baby shower, anniversary, celebration, party or any other event. But also clear place cards are great table decor for a restaurant, bar, cafe and other catering business.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PPU2NJH+L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OurWarm","source_asin":"B083GGM6L9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-915297","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083GGM6L9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083GGM6L9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":915298,"name":"MALOUF 400 Thread Count Genuine Egyptian Cotton Pillowcase Set - Chocolate - Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411AJkXTuUL._AC_.jpg","description":"Authentic Egyptian cotton this product is 100% authentic, single-ply, single-pick, long-staple Egyptian cotton. Yes, there was a lot we had to clarify there because there are several ways other brands try to deceive consumers. Egyptian cotton is superior to most other sheet material because of the long-staple. While the long-staple can be found in other cottons, it is most predominantly found in Egyptian grown cotton. This long-staple allows the cotton to be woven more extensively, creating a softer and more durable sheet that is resistant to pilling. The carefully crafted weave makes Egyptian cotton sheets more breathable. You can see why authentic Egyptian cotton sheets are so desirable; unfortunately, a lot of consumers are tricked into purchasing inferior products. Most oversized DimensionsMalouf manufactures their linens to the most oversized dimensions available. Fitted sheets accommodate mattress depths from 6 to 22 inches, perfect for thick mattresses or beds with mattress toppers. The ultra-thick fitted sheet elastic goes all the way around the mattress to guarantee a secure fit. Superb WorkmanshipMalouf's Egyptian cotton is finely woven to produce a true 400 thread count, but thread count alone is not the best way to measure Egyptian cotton quality. The single-ply cotton is mercerized to strengthen the fibers, give them a more lustrous appearance and a softer feel. Designed in the U.S., Imported materials were used to provide the highest levels of quality and comfort. Available in white, ivory, khaki, chocolate, silver sage, and slate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411AJkXTuUL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MALOUF","source_asin":"B009MA2ZKC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-915298","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009MA2ZKC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009MA2ZKC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
