window.products.push({"id":915366,"name":"Tribello 8 X 4 Loaf Pans For Baking Bread Aluminum - 2 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Rbz36v2bL._AC_SL1152_.jpg","description":"If you are an experienced baker or just strive for perfection, A good cake pan may make or break your baking experience. Aluminum is an excellent material for bakeware and is often used by professionals. When you are in need of new bakeware, aluminum prevails in kitchens because it is inexpensive and relatively light. Aluminum cake pans are the best material for baking the perfect cake, it distributes heat quickly and evenly so the crust does not bake faster than the filling ensures a delicious appetizing cake. To ease the aftermath cleaning It's preferred to line cake and cookie pans with parchment paper, to create a non-stick surface, so brownies, gingerbread, and other square cakes will come out easily. buy according to what you like to bake whether it's round, square, or rectangular There are a wide variety of cake pans sizes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Rbz36v2bL._AC_SL1152_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tribello","source_asin":"B08MTGP87M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-915366","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MTGP87M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MTGP87M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
