window.products.push({"id":915413,"name":"Kitchen Knife and Scissors Set Multi-Purpose Food Shears and Ultra Sharp Utility Knife with Safety Blade Cover 3pc Cutlery Peeler Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pRg4ulrWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"We are committed to creating healthy and safe home kitchen supplies, providing good service, any questions you can contact us, we will help you solve the problem within 24 hours. Sets includes: 1 x 8” Stainless Steel Multi-purpose Heavy Duty Kitchen Shears; 1 x 5” Super Sharp Utility Knife with protective blade sheath;  1 x Ceramic Fruit Peeler;  This kitchen shears/knife and peeler set meets almost all the kitchen cutting needs. It’s a perfect gift item for family and friends. INSTRUCTIONS & ATTENTION: - Keep out of children’s reach. - Sharp blade, please be careful during use. - Do not cut food on hard objects (for utility knife). - Please do not cut hard objects to maintain the sharp edge of the blade. - After using the product, please use warm water, mild detergent and a towel to clean, wipe dry and store in an area with good ventilation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pRg4ulrWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"5mile-XSR","source_asin":"B07KRV1R1M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-915413","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KRV1R1M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KRV1R1M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":915414,"name":"INDISTAR Colourful Stripe Star Cut-Out Blackout Curtains for Bedroom,2 Layers Mix Design of Fabric & Tulle,Pretty Window Curtain for Kids Room 2 Panel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y-YKU-WWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hollow Star - Elegant double-layer star cutout blackout curtain, the whole panel is a unique rainbow gradient color, beautiful and generous. With the hollowed-out stars accurately cut by useful laser technology, when the light passes, the room will show the whole twinkling star sky, the dreamlike rainbow color, especially suitable for the girl's bedroom. The colorful curtains flutter with the wind, adding romantic, warm and lovely feeling to the girl's room Home Decoration - Beautiful and elegant girls curtain. Add wonderful color and fashionable design to your living space. The curtain adopts unique fine knitting technology, which has good shading performance. Suitable for kids, girls boys bedroom, living room, bedroom, study, etc Double Layer Design - Beautiful kids star blackout curtain using high-quality shading cloth and interesting White Tulle collocation, highlighting the hazy and fashionable design aesthetic feeling. The side of the hollowed-out star cutout curtains is fan-shaped, with beautiful tulle and elegant lace. The morning lights through the hollowed-out stars, through the gauze, less light on your sleepy eyes, bring you a good mood, perfect decoration for your room Packaging - 2-panel star curtain and 2pcs curtain rope in per package.Each curtain panel has 8 grommets on top. The ring is quieter when it is pulled. Each grommet inner diameter is 1.15 inch, comparable with most rods. Easy to hang, and slide smoothly Easy to Care - The star curtain can be machine washed in cold water. Gently cycle. Wash with mild detergent. It can be dried if necessary. Dry in a well ventilated place. Don't bleach. Pure and bright color, not easy to fade","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y-YKU-WWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"indistar","source_asin":"B099ZSV87W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-915414","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099ZSV87W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099ZSV87W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":915415,"name":"30 Inch Christmas Wreath Gnome, Pine Needle Christmas Gnome Wreath for Front Door, Hanging Ornament Swedish Tomte Christmas Decorations Wreath for Roo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T-CfjOSlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【30 Inch Santa Gnome Christmas Wreath】The hanging Christmas wreath is a pine needle Christmas gnome doctor. The Swedish Tomte wreath holds a card printing MERRY CHRISTMAS in his hands to greet everyone. 【Stuffed Fleece Hat & Artificial Pine Needle】The Christmas wreath is made on a high-quality polyester pine needle, durable & non-toxic. And have a stuffed fleece hat, soft & comfortable. And the inside of its hat is supported by iron wires, you can adjust the hat to a different shape. 【With 39-Inch 10 Lamp Beads Led Light String】The Gnome Christmas wreath comes with a 39 inches 10 lamp beads led light string, you can wrap it around the Christmas gnome wreath. BUTTON BATTERIES INCLUDED. 【Best Christmas Greeting】This Santa gnome door hanging wreath is perfect for greeting your guests during the Christmas season. Use this Christmas wreath to decorate your home, adding a Christmas atmosphere and creating a new look to the home. Hang it on the wall, front door, window, porch, or corridor. 【Perfect Christmas Gift】This Christmas wreath gnomes are also known as Tomte or Nisse. In folklore, Swedish gnomes guard home and protect people from misfortune. Santa gnomes elf will bring us good luck, happiness, and warmth. Great gift choice for your family, lovers, and friends to express your Christmas wishes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T-CfjOSlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rotkfst","source_asin":"B0C7K8G2NG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-915415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7K8G2NG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7K8G2NG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
