window.products.push({"id":915452,"name":"Tucker Sedan (1948) Car Print on 10 Mil Archival Satin Paper Blue Front Side Static View 16\"x20\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A11ovosCFFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This beautiful, hard to find high resolution masterpiece is printed when you order and are never “off the shelf”. We use only the finest Kodak Paper and quality inks assuring you a lifetime of enjoyment. Framed Print Info ----- We offer prints framed in either of two frame types -- light walnut or dark walnut. Both are 1\" wide, 3/4\" thick, smooth finish, wood composite with wood grain pattern. Please refer to the inset photos in the upper Left side of the page. Prints fit 1/4\" within the frame on each side. The frames are specifTucker based on the print size they accept, so, e.g., a 12 x 18 frame accepts a 12 x 18 print, measures about 13.5\" x 19.5\" outside, 11.5\" x 17.5\" inside. Mats are simulated and not linen material. When we print, we add a border based on the mat color choice you have made. The simulated mats have a slight texture, simulating a linen material. The prints are shipped with a non-glare glass or Plexiglas Front. Mounting hardware is taped to the back. Once the mounting hardware is attached, the prints are ready to hang on the wall. The only media we offer for framed prints is enhanced matte. Inasmuch as the prints are mounted behind glass (or Plexiglas), we feel that this media provides the best result. Framed prints require 3 business days to ship.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A11ovosCFFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classic and Muscle Car Ads and Car Art","source_asin":"B01FMJO8YW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-915452","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FMJO8YW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FMJO8YW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
