window.products.push({"id":915513,"name":"25' Stair Runner Rugs - Luxury Mahal Collection Stair Carpet Runner - Nearly 1 Million Points per sq.Meter(Ivory)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ARZQVeg5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beautify your stairs with the Kashan Collection's 25' Stair Runners featuring stunning Turkish patterns woven into plush, durable stain-resistant rug fabric. The fibers in these durable Turkish rug runners are naturally abrasion and sunlight resistant. Each stair runner is constructed of heat set Olefin with a luxurious, nearly 1 million, points of fabric per square meter, a pile height of 10 mm, and a width of 26 inches. This assortment features an updated look on traditional/classical patterns. Bringing the more popular gray/blue color combinations as well as a slight abraje effect. If you're comparing prices on stair runners, you might find the following information useful: Points Per Square Meter is the measure of how many threads of fabric stick up from the top of the backing of the stair runner. Typically, the more points per square meter, the higher quality of the stair runner. Our runners feature close to 1 million points per square meter, which is generally higher then what you'll find in most big box home improvement stores. Pile Height is a measurement from the top of each thread (known as a Pile) to the top of the stair runner's backing material. The higher the pile height, the more cushioning you'll feel beneath your feet. Our runners feature an 10 mm pile height, which is higher then what you can expect to find in most non-specialty retailers. The durability of the carpet, sharpness and clarity of the pattern, and the cushioning feel of a stair runner are all factors of Points Per Square Meter, and Pile Height. Lastly, our runners are 100% finished, which means you won't need any aftermarket work done before installation. Care instructions: Vacuum regularly. Clean spills immediately by blotting with a clean sponge or cloth. Periodic dry cleaning is recommended. Made in Turkey","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ARZQVeg5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Westerly","source_asin":"B0C41RMYSS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-915513","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C41RMYSS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C41RMYSS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
