window.products.push({"id":915630,"name":"Modern Wooden Clock for Kids Paw Print Metal Look Nursery Round Wood Clock for Kitchen Decor 14 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gd2Kk530L._AC_.jpg","description":"Description: Wooden wall clock is made of wooden MDF, wood particle board painted, covered by paper drawing, various designs paper cover on MDF available. Add charm to any room in your home. AA battery is required for this clock (not included). Farm house and vintage wall wooden clock can be a good gift at housewarmings, weddings, and social gatherings. Instruction: 1. There is an instruction in the shipping box, if you have problem with the clock, please fix hands set with the instruction. 2. The clock is not framed, also no glass face as the cover. If hands touch each other, you can adjust the hands to avoid the hands touching. If the hands drop down, don't worry, they are just loose, just press hands tight on the core shaft to make the hands parallel, then the hands will not drop and will keep time. 3. Sometimes the movement is not work just for the wrong place of the second hand. The red second hand is too deep or too shallow will effect the movement. You can pull the red second hand out and then add it again, then clock work well. There are slight difference between the picture and the real item caused by light brightness. Because the batteries is limited by international transport, the battery is no contain, please pay attention.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gd2Kk530L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moonluna","source_asin":"B07KSBDL2M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-915630","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KSBDL2M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KSBDL2M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
