window.products.push({"id":915635,"name":"120 PCS Mylar Bags For Food Storage, 1 Gallon Mylar Bags With Oxygen Absorbers - 300CC×120, Large Aluminum Mylar Bags 1 Gallon 10\"x14\", 1 Quart 9.5\"x6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zxq9sSR7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【100% airtight & keep fresh】: Our mylar bags are made of high-quality food-grade aluminum foil, even the light from the flashlight cannot be transmitted in. They can be sealed for food storage, prevent the air into the bags and achieve the food does not go bad. Meanwhile, it can 100% keep the food original taste and fresh, will not be mixed with odors when stored like other inferior mylar bags. 【No longer worry about long-term storage】: The thicker version of mylar bags is 9.6 mils thick and added a layer of aluminum foil inside to greatly improve the sealing ability of mylar bags. It is strong enough, puncture-resistant, not easy to break. The bags will not be easily worn like cheap quality bags that quickly break then appear small holes and air comes in. So we do not need to worry about the prepared-well food going bad when stored. Usage tips】: Mylar bags can be heated and sealed with hot irons or heat-sealing machines to protect food from oxygen, moisture, and light degradation. This can be used to dehydrate and store food, including grains, dried vegetables, beans, dried fruits, oats, coffee beans, candy, tea, etc. 【The perfect kit meets all needs】: The set includes 120 pcs mylar bags（10\"x14\", 25pcs）（9.5\"x6.7\", 35pcs）(4.5\"x6.5\", 35pcs）(3.6\"x5.2\", 15pcs）(3.2\"x4\", 10pcs）, 120 pcs stickers, 120 pcs 300cc oxygen absorbers packets (Notice: oxygen absorbers only absorb O2, about 21% of air, not achieve \"vacuum packaging\" totally) Plateau ELK aim to provide high-quality products and services to enhance the customer's pleasant shopping experience. If you have any problems about the item, please contact us directly, we will reply within 24 hours and solve your problems as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zxq9sSR7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Plateau ELK","source_asin":"B09V4TF9DV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-915635","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V4TF9DV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V4TF9DV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
