window.products.push({"id":915744,"name":"Spancraft 25\" Round 1/4\" Thick Tempered Clear Glass Table Top with Flat Polished Edge","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":81.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MVwgcQgbL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"25\" ROUND GLASSTOPS  Features: Finest quality furniture glass. Edges and corners expertly polished. Expertly packed to ensure safe arrival. Glass is individually cartoned with styrofoam protection. Free bumpons included to place between glass tops & base. 25\" ROUND GLASS TOPSThe 25\" Round Glass Top is made of the highest quality furniture glass. This clear glass tabletop is available in a few variations. It is available in a ¼ inch thickness, which is tempered glass and has a smooth flat polish edge & a weight of 21 lbs. The 25\" diameter glass top is also available in a ½\" thickness which has a smooth 1\" bevel edge and is 35 lbs. The edges of the glass are expertly polished to ensure a bright, smooth to the touch feel.This small round glass top is perfect to use as a replacement glass or use to create a contemporary glass end table, decorative glass accent table or small coffee table. Also, this clear glass top is perfect as a table protector. Glass top tables are popular since they can easily fit in with a wide variety of home decor and style of a space. This is a perfect addition to your dining room, living room or bedroom. These beautiful glass tops are available in many sizes, thicknesses and edgework.Each round glass top includes free bumpons to place in between the glass and base of the table. They are professionally packed and individually cartoned with Styrofoam to protect from breakage during transit. The 25\" clear round glass tabletop ships quickly via Fedex and is also insured to ensure a safe arrival.Shopping for Round Glass Tops online is simple at Glass Tops Direct. We feature many variations in size, shape, thickness and edge work as well as custom glass sizes. We feature different glass strengths depending on thickness. Whether you are purchasing a glass top as a replacement or as a table pro","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MVwgcQgbL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spancraft","source_asin":"B004E5Y92C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-915744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004E5Y92C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004E5Y92C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
