window.products.push({"id":915826,"name":"Creative Converting Vintage Vixen 40th Birthday 2-Sided Round Mylar Balloon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516WM70GJaL._AC_.jpg","description":"Like a fine wine, our Vintage Vixen collection celebrates the perfectly aged lady's 40th birthday. Metallic foil Mylar balloon has an 18\" diameter and is printed on both sides for easy decorating. This item ships flat and can be filled with your own helium or air so just inflate and decorate. Classy foil balloon professes the guest of honor is \"perfectly aged - bold and leggy with a hint of sass\" and will make turning the big 4-O a big hit. She's a classic with a velvety elegance yet with a burst of good-humored fun. This ensemble captures the spirit of a woman who has it all: grace, style and a great sense of humor. You can't rush perfection, but you can make her party look perfect with coordinating tableware and decor from Creative Converting. From invitations to tableware to tablecloths, this ensemble has everything to make the celebration a one-of-a-kind event!.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516WM70GJaL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Converting","source_asin":"B00BEH8AKU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-915826","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BEH8AKU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BEH8AKU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
