window.products.push({"id":915887,"name":"Bee's Wrap - Lunch Pack - Made in the US - Beeswax Food Wrap - Bees and Bears Print - 3 Pieces (Sandwich Wrap, 2 Medium Food Wraps)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hV7BCB2XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A fresh take on food storage: uniquely designed reusable beeswax food wraps that eliminate single use plastic and keep food fresh; from prepping meals and storing leftovers in the kitchen to packing lunches and snacks on the go, Bee's Wrap has you covered; an easy, yet thoughtful gift for the holidays, housewarmings, dinner parties, and potlucks. Plastic and silicone free; because good food deserves good care. Use your medium wraps (10\"x11\") for cheese, baked goods, half a cabbage or grapefruit, or covering a Mason jar or small bowl and packing snacks; Use your sandwich wrap to pack your lunch and keep it fresh. Made in the USA with certified organic cotton, responsibly sourced beeswax, certified organic plant oils, and tree resin; this combination creates a durable, yet pliable plastic wrap alternative that can be used again and again. Wrap Care 101; use the warmth of your hand to create a seal around food, bowls and pans; Bee’s Wrap will hold its shape when it cools, creating a breathable seal; rinse your beeswax wrap in cool water with mild soap, then air dry; reuse your Bee’s Wrap for up to a year with regular use and proper care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hV7BCB2XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bee's Wrap","source_asin":"B0959L8DPJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-915887","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0959L8DPJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0959L8DPJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
